# This directory is the build context (build.sh passes its own dir to buildx),
# and docker only reads .dockerignore from the context root, so this file must
# stay beside the Dockerfile. The Dockerfile only COPYs the stage dirs
# (assembled by build.sh beside it); excluding everything else keeps the context
# small and keeps bundle/, buildspec.yml, and build.sh out of the image.
*
!addons-stage/
!frontend-stage/
